"//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14wt9.jpg"}], "slug": "white-dwarf", "storyline": "You are a white dwarf: a burnt-out stellar remnant, small, dense, and mostly harmless. The rock field around you does not care. It closes in from every direction, and it gets worse with every minute you stay alive.", "summary": "White Dwarf is a top-down survival shooter about holding onto a piece of empty space for as long as you can. Your weapon fires automatically at the nearest target, so the only things you control are where you stand and when you spend your cooldowns. Everything else comes down to the choices you make along the way.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/white-dwarf", "videos": [{"id": 194149, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "J6RBAu3qo-4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J6RBAu3qo-4", "title": "White Dwarf: A cosmic survival roguelite. | Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/J6RBAu3qo-4/fhddefault.jpg"}]}